.TH OMATRIMIO 1 "2026-11-10" "omatrimio" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
omatrimio \- a Stremio-compatible media center with the Omarchy look
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B omatrimio
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIURI\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B omatrimio
is a GTK4 desktop application that embeds the Stremio web client (via
WebKitGTK6) beside a local streaming server and an mpv player, and restyles
it to follow the Omarchy desktop: the current theme's colors, the desktop
font, Hyprland's window rounding, and Omarchy's icon style.
.PP
It is an unofficial fork of stremio-linux-shell, not affiliated with Stremio
or Smart Code OOD.
.PP
The streaming server is Stremio's own program. On first run it is downloaded
from Stremio's site, checked against a pinned checksum, and kept in the data
directory. It is run with
.BR node .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-dev
Open the WebKit developer tools on startup.
.TP
.BR \-u ", " \-\-url =\fIURL\fR
Set the startup URL loaded in the embedded browser view.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-no\-window\-decorations
Hide the header bar. This is already the default; the header can be turned
back on in the preferences.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print a short help summary and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version number and exit.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I URI
A stremio:// link or media file to open.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SERVER_PATH
Run this streaming server script instead of the downloaded one.
.TP
.B OMATRIMIO_CPU_RENDERING
Set to 1 or 0 to force drawing the interface on the CPU or the GPU. By
default the CPU is used when every display adapter is virtual.
.TP
.B OMATRIMIO_DEBUG
Print the web page's console to the terminal.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/omatrimio
Web storage (the signed-in account) and the streaming server.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/omarchy/current/theme/colors.toml
The Omarchy theme the app follows.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Ctrl+,
Preferences.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
Quit.
